# Reproduce the waves path on picorv32_console; use gui_record.py run --start-screen.
# top_routed.json has cpu.reg_pc[2] and all 64 bits cpu.count_cycle[0]..[63].
1 open target/reference/picorv32_console/top.config
# Times below count from when the opened design is ready.
0 rate real
1 run
8 waves open
9 watch cpu.reg_pc[2]
10 watch cpu.count_cycle
12 point 0.5 0.5
12.5 watch pointed
13 watch shown
20 rate 4
35 rate max
45 pause
50 quit
